---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Sula Chai Café Vancouver | Authentic Indian Chai, Alai Coffee & Indian-Inspired Bakery"
	description="Sula Chai Café on East 5th Avenue, Vancouver. Sula chai brewed with tea from Coorg, exclusive Alai Coffee blend, paninis on house-made masala focaccia, daily-baked Indian-inspired pastries. Takeout & UberEats."
	canonical="/"
>

	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="Sula Chai Café" class="hero-logo" />
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">From The Sula Indian Restaurant Team</span>
			<h1>Sip the moment.<br/><em>Taste the tradition.</em></h1>
			<div class="premium-divider">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p class="hero-tagline">A takeout-only café tucked into East Vancouver, with an artisanal bakery at its heart. Sula chai brewed with tea from Coorg, Alai Coffee crafted exclusively for us, and Indian-inspired baked goods made fresh every morning.</p>
			<div class="hero-buttons">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
					</span>
					Order on UberEats
				</a>
				<a href="/menu" class="btn-outline-cocoa">
					<span class="btn-badge">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
					</span>
					Explore Menu
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="section-divider">
		<div class="premium-divider">
			<div class="pd-thin"></div>
			<div class="pd-thick"></div>
			<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" class="pd-logo" />
			<div class="pd-thick"></div>
			<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="section section-cream-reverse reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-img cocoa">
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-jaali"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
				<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/chai-near-me-vancouver-sula-chai-cafe.webp" alt="Sula Chai brewed fresh in Vancouver from Coorg and Chikmagalur tea leaves" />
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Sula Chai</span>
				<h2>Tea leaves from <em>Coorg & Chikmagalur.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Often called the Scotland of India, these cool, mist-covered highlands produce some of the country's most aromatic, full-bodied teas. The elevation, rainfall, and rich soil create leaves with unmistakable depth and natural sweetness.</p>
				<p>Saffron from the north. Pistachio from royal kitchens. Rose from ancient markets. Coastal jaggery from the south. Each chai recipe layers traditional spices with nostalgic Indian flavours, reimagined into a modern artisanal experience.</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag">Masala</span>
					<span class="tag">Lavender</span>
					<span class="tag">Pistachio</span>
					<span class="tag">Gulabi</span>
					<span class="tag">Spicy Ginger</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal">
		<div class="two-col container">
			<div class="two-col-content">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Alai Coffee Partnership</span>
				<h2>Crafted by <em>Alai.</em> Brewed at <em>Sula.</em></h2>
				<div class="mini-divider">
					<div class="m-line"></div>
					<div class="m-diamond"></div>
					<div class="m-line"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Alongside Sula Chai, we proudly serve the Exclusive Sula Blend by Alai Coffee , a South Asian, women-owned micro-roaster in Vancouver who source and roast from India's coffee belt in Chikmagalur and Odisha.</p>
				<p>Coconut from the coast. Warm jaggery. Fragrant pistachio. Monsoon spice. Each drink is an original creation inspired by India's dessert traditions, integrated into modern specialty coffee formats unlike anything else in the city.</p>
				<div class="tag-row">
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Jaggery Velvet Latte</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Coastal Coconut Cap</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Malai Pista Mocha</span>
					<span class="tag tag-cream">Indian Filter Coffee</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="two-col-img espresso">
				<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-block"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-frame"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-corner tl"></div>
				<div class="two-col-img-corner br"></div>
				<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/alai-coffee-vancouver.webp" alt="Alai Coffee exclusive Sula blend roasted in Vancouver from Chikmagalur and Odisha" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="section-divider">
		<div class="premium-divider">
			<div class="pd-thin"></div>
			<div class="pd-thick"></div>
			<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" class="pd-logo" />
			<div class="pd-thick"></div>
			<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="section section-cream reveal">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Our Baked Goods</span>
				<h2>Indian neighborhood bakeries, with a <em>Vancouver twist.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Spiced cookies and chai-infused cakes, muffins and pastries. Plus our signature paninis on house-made masala focaccia, made in partnership with Union Market. Every bite, fresh and crafted with care.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<a href="/menu#savory" class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img cocoa">
						<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-wave"></div>
						<span class="card-img-label">Paneer</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Masala Focaccia</span>
						<h3>Paneer & Chicken <em>Paninis</em></h3>
						<p>Chimichurri paneer. Pesto chicken tikka. Pressed in masala focaccia from Union Market.</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<a href="/menu#sweets" class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img espresso">
						<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-star"></div>
						<span class="card-img-label">Cruffin</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sweet Pastries</span>
						<h3>Cruffins & <em>Croissants</em></h3>
						<p>Lime coconut. Tiramisu. Orange chocolate pain suisse. Pistachio loaf. All baked daily.</p>
					</div>
				</a>

				<a href="/menu#cookies" class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img tan">
						<div class="pattern-overlay pattern-block"></div>
						<span class="card-img-label">Cookies</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Cookies & Treats</span>
						<h3>Cookies & <em>Macaroons</em></h3>
						<p>Brown butter espresso. Pistachio malai. Chocolate chip. Plus samosas with chutneys.</p>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-espresso reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Catering & Events</span>
			<h2>Bring Sula <em>to your gathering.</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p style="max-width:680px;margin:24px auto 36px">From corporate meetings to weddings and private parties, we offer freshly brewed Indian chai served in signature decanters, bold Alai Coffee, and catering boxes filled with handcrafted baked delights perfect for sharing.</p>
			<div style="display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
				<a href="/catering" class="cta">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
					</span>
					Explore Catering
				</a>
				<a href="/wholesale" class="btn-outline-cream">
					<span class="btn-badge">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
					</span>
					Wholesale Bakery
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cocoa reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic" style="color:var(--burnt-light)">Visit Us</span>
			<h2>Find us in <em>East Vancouver.</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="visit-info">
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Address</div>
					<div class="value">260 East 5th Ave</div>
				</div>
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Service</div>
					<div class="value">Takeout · UberEats</div>
				</div>
				<div class="visit-info-item">
					<div class="label">Call</div>
					<div class="value">778-386-1130</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div style="margin-top:50px">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
					</span>
					Order on UberEats
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
